   "synthesis": "- **Membership discrimination is the dominant durable skill.** Learn members/non-members through contrasts, not isolated lists.\n- **Current expansion questions are usually static-core + one fresh delta.** Keep founding/origin/institutional identity permanent; refresh only the membership delta.\n- **EU is a repeated institutional-confusion zone:** Commission / Parliament / European Council / ECB / ESM / EU pacts.\n- UPSC frequently embeds a **false origin story** or **false mandate** inside an otherwise familiar grouping.\n- UPPCS adds a replaceable layer of **summit host, theme, logo, chairmanship and venue**."
  },
