     "label": "General",
     "ids": [
      "UPPCS-2019-GS1-Q119",
      "UPPCS-2020-GS1-Q063",
      "UPPCS-2022-GS1-Q085",
      "UPPCS-2022-GS1-Q121",
      "UPPCS-2023-GS1-Q126",
      "UPPCS-2024-GS1-Q006",
      "UPPCS-2024-GS1-Q052",
      "UPPCS-2024-GS1-Q139",
      "UPPCS-2025-GS1-Q059"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "synthesis": "- Recurring UPSC pattern = **institutional parentage + legal status + precise mandate**.\n- Learn convention families as **parent treaty → protocol → implementing/secretariat body → subject**.\n- UN questions repeatedly punish the assumption that every UN-linked entity is a **specialised agency**.\n- Maritime-law questions demand exact **zone + right + institution** mapping.\n- UPPCS fixed **day/date** facts are worth a compact revision table; **annual themes remain ↻ DYNAMIC**."
  },
