   "uppcs": [],
   "synthesis": "- The dominant question is not “what does the body do?” but **what kind of body is it?**\n- Elimination should start with: **UN entity? intergovernmental? NGO/non-profit? commission? treaty body?**\n- “Consultative status with ECOSOC” **does not make an NGO a UN agency**.\n- Private/non-profit initiatives are frequently paired with a plausible but false UN/IEA/World Bank parentage."
  },
